well today is the deadline to file your  taxes big news in regards to tax relief  when it comes to working families with  kids  kirsten joyce joining us now with the  details  millions of middle and low-income  families across the country will start  receiving monthly payments  as part of a new fully refundable child  tax credit  these advance payments were included as  part of the american rescue plan passed  in march to provide relief for families  during the pandemic  the maximum child tax credit increased  from two thousand to thirty six hundred  for children under the age of six  and three thousand for children six  years of age and up  it also made the credit fully refundable  and turned  half of the credit into what will become  direct deposits right into your bank  account  here's the great news you won't have to  wait until your next year's tax return  to get that break  i'm announcing today that on july 15  and the 15th of every month thereafter  throughout the year  you will get deposited in your bank  account half of your tax cut at least  250 dollars per child each month  a direct deposit into your account  under the american rescue plan  individuals making up to 75  000 annually single parent head of  household filers making up to a hundred  twelve thousand five hundred and married  couples who file  jointly with a combined income of up to  a hundred fifty 000 per year  are eligible to receive the full amount  i'm kirsten joyce
 

